# Purpose

This document defines the visual and user-interface standards for the House of Lady Amour website.

The design system will help maintain consistency across pages, reusable components, Shopify products, recipes, books, videos, and future website features.

---

# Brand Experience

The House of Lady Amour should feel:

- Faith-centered
- Warm
- Elegant
- Welcoming
- Romantic
- Peaceful
- Countryside-inspired
- Timeless
- Creative
- Luxurious without feeling unapproachable

---

# Brand Principles

## Faith First

Faith in God is the foundation of the Lady Amour brand and should be reflected respectfully throughout the website.

## Beauty in Simplicity

Layouts should feel graceful and uncluttered. Decorative details should support the content rather than overwhelm it.

## Warm Hospitality

Visitors should feel welcomed into the House of Lady Amour rather than directed through a traditional commercial website.

## Meaningful Storytelling

Books, recipes, videos, products, and photographs should be presented through stories and experiences.

## Consistency

Colors, typography, buttons, spacing, imagery, and component behavior should remain consistent throughout the website.

