# Design Review Checklist

Before approving a page, confirm:

- The page matches the Lady Amour visual identity.
- Text is readable.
- Mobile layout works.
- Buttons are clear.
- Images are optimized.
- Alternative text is included.
- Color contrast is sufficient.
- Spacing is consistent.
- Navigation is understandable.
- The page does not feel overcrowded.

